{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>台積電下一代A14（1.4nm級）先進制程迎來重要進展。在2026年歐洲開放創新平台生態研討會上，台積電宣佈A14工藝設計套件PDK 0.9版已經就緒，客户可以正式啓動晶片設計工作。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588200.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:03:52.159161+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:38:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:57:14.240428+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:57:14.240428+00:00","content_hash":"ee85435f22ab9830c79c4a09ba8a6f59b0bef2a174c21a666f3bbb6f4dd8b953","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}